/-!
# The BoringMath library

`BoringMath` holds candidate extensions to Mathlib, organized exactly as if
they were pull requests one could realistically submit: each contribution is
a small, self-contained module that could be dropped into Mathlib after
review.

All code is written in the *boring style*; see `docs/STYLE.md` for the
binding style rules.
-/
